{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16207070","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16207070","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1620707001:1":{"text":"레이너스... 레이너스...","source_cn":"莱纳斯……莱纳斯……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x835E35B21C14286D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1620707002:1":{"text":"어? 피파! 나 찾았어? 네 옆에 있잖아!","source_cn":"嘿！皮帕，你是在找我吗？我就在你旁边！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x65DF9A80E3FE0AAD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1620707003:1":{"text":"미, 미, 미안! 못 봤어!","source_cn":"对对对对不起！我刚才没有看到你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE258A3E04F9AFB4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1620707004:1":{"text":"멀린 님도 계셔! 방금 네가 발명한 혼돈 마법을 체험해 보셨어!","source_cn":"梅林大人也在呢！<male>他</male><fema...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x11A41F7C95FA372E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"멀린 님도 계셔! 방금 네가 발명한 혼돈 마법을 체험해 보셨어!","female":"멀린 님도 계셔! 방금 네가 발명한 혼돈 마법을 체험해 보셨어!","variant_male_record_index":"203838","variant_female_record_index":"203839","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1620707005:1":{"text":"이 마법을 알려줘서 고마워. 진짜 대단하더라! 더 많은 사람들이 이 마법의 재미를 느꼈으면 좋겠어!","source_cn":"说起来还要感谢你教会了我用它，太了不起了！我已经迫不及...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD25C2C91C1575C66","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1620707006:1":{"text":"어... 아아아! 잠깐! 안 그래도 그 얘기를 하려고 했었어!","source_cn":"欸……啊啊啊等等！我想找你说的就是这个！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6DA4E24F0441FC28","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1620707007:1":{"text":"분명 어제 너한테만 혼돈 마법을 가르쳐줬는데, 왜 오늘 아카데미가 온통 혼돈 마법 천지인 거야...","source_cn":"我记得我昨天只教了你使用混沌魔法的方法，为什么今天学校...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x757F21D9CD70715B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1620707008:1":{"text":"그게... 여기저기 퍼진 거지 뭐. 재미있는 건 다들 해보고 싶어 하잖아!","source_cn":"这个……一传十十传百嘛，好玩的事情大家都想尝试！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8B5A2A31053D43CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1620707009:1":{"text":"하지만 마법을 제대로 제어하지 못하면 위험한 일이 생길 수도 있어...","source_cn":"可是，没办法控制魔法的结果，就有可能发生危险的事……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1667625042A9210D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1620707010:1":{"text":"혼돈 마법 때문에 사고라도 나면 큰일이야... 그리고 이 마법을 만든 사람이 나라는 사실이 들통나면, 당장 퇴학당할 거라고!","source_cn":"如果混沌魔法引发了危险的事，再被学校发现发明这种危险魔...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD6E50BB69D340258","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1620707011:1":{"text":"위험한 일? 사고? 지금까지 전혀 그런 일 없었어.","source_cn":"危险？我看不出混沌魔法会有什么危险啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB5980BF74A69D070","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1620707012:1":{"text":"걱정 마. 어제부터 수도 없이 써봤는데 아무 문제 없었어! 한 번 더 해볼 테니까 잘 봐...","source_cn":"放心吧，我从昨天到今天已经用了很多次了，不会有什么危险...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4DE793D7AC687A92","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:皮帕":{"text":"피파","source":"皮帕","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:莱纳斯":{"text":"레이너스","source":"莱纳斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":13,"localized_text_count":12,"speaker_count":2}}